{"id": "unknown-2026-05-09-003", "date": "2026-05-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Chattogram collision exposes Bangladesh’s RMG chokepoint", "content": "Bangladesh’s RMG chokepoint just cracked: a May 1 collision at Chattogram, handling 98 per cent of containerised exim, stranded 2,800 import TEUs and froze export loadings. \nIt hits a sector already squeezed by cotton +24.7 per cent YoY, port tariffs +41 per cent, and 8–10 per cent Western order cuts. \nWith LDC graduation due this November, buyers will accelerate diversion to Vietnam and India.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/chattogram-collision-exposes-bangladesh-s-rmg-chokepoint-310192-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-09-004", "date": "2026-05-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 19, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EU hopeful of India FTA’s smooth ratification; may be enforced in 2027", "content": "The EU is hopeful of a smooth ratification process of its FTA with India in its Parliament, given the broad-based political support for it, EU ambassador to India Herve Delphin recently said. \nThe pact, which was earlier expected to be implemented by 2026 end, would enter into force in 2027. \nThe envoy also made a case for speedy conclusion of the ongoing negotiation on an investment protection pact. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/eu-hopeful-of-india-fta-s-smooth-ratification-may-be-enforced-in-2027-310202-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
